@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 19
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F7F9FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #4B5966
|Detection Analyst|
start
:Select recorded potential detection;
:Review sensor features, location and provenance;
:Enter assessment and notes;
|FastAPI|
if (Authorized and detection accessible?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Reject review;
  stop
endif
if (Assessment and notes valid?) then (yes)
  :Store analyst review;
  :Append audit event;
else (no)
  :Return validation error;
  stop
endif
|Detection Analyst|
:View saved assessment;
note right
  Synthetic provenance and experimental version are retained.
  An assessment does not verify a landmine or clear ground.
end note
stop
@enduml
